    "question": "How will I know that the withdrawal has been successful?",
    "answer": "You will get an automatic notification once we send the funds and you can always check your transactions or account balance. Your chosen payment system dictates how long it will take for the funds to reach you.",
    "order": 2,
    "is_active": true
